Package: sign-everything
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Dmitry Petrovsky <crashday_game@mail.ru>
Homepage: https://github.com/Tripswarlock/sign-everything
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-pyqt5, python3-cryptography
Recommends: python3-keyring, pcscd
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: Mass file signing via CryptoPro CSP
 Sign Everything is a desktop utility for recursively signing files with
 detached signatures using cryptcp from CryptoPro CSP. It supports hardware
 tokens, certificate selection, progress, cancellation and remembers the PIN
 in the system keyring or an encrypted local vault.
